{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_88_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"一、二十有五年，春，王正月，丙午，衞侯燬滅邢。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"燬之名何也？不正其伐本而滅同姓也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，癸酉，衞侯燬卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"三、宋蕩伯姬來逆婦。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"婦人既嫁不踰竟。宋蕩伯姬來逆婦，非正也。其曰婦何也？緣姑言之之辭也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"四、宋殺其大夫。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"其不稱名姓，以其在祖之位，尊之也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"五、秋，楚人圍陳，納頓子於頓。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"納者，內弗受也。圍一事也，納一事也，而遂言之，蓋納頓子者陳也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"六、葬衞文公。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有二月，癸亥，公會衞子、莒慶盟於洮。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_88_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_88","textTraditional":"莒無大夫，其曰莒慶何也？以公之會目之也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}